1
00:00:00,979 --> 00:00:03,149
(Leonard:)it was kind of a spur
of the moment thing,

2
00:00:03,148 --> 00:00:05,278
(Leonard:)and also, we don't like her.

3
00:00:05,284 --> 00:00:06,854
(Penny:)Leonard, come on,
she's your mom.

4
00:00:06,852 --> 00:00:08,882
(Penny:)If we can do something
to make her happy,

5
00:00:08,887 --> 00:00:09,787
(Penny:)why wouldn't we?

6
00:00:09,788 --> 00:00:11,058
(Leonard:)I just said why...

7
00:00:11,056 --> 00:00:12,786
(Leonard:)we don't like her.

8
00:00:12,791 --> 00:00:14,091
(Penny:)Hey, look,
then forget about her,

9
00:00:14,093 --> 00:00:15,263
(Penny:)let's do it for us.

10
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:16,590
(Penny:)We could keep it
small and informal.

11
00:00:16,595 --> 00:00:18,065
(Penny:)This time we can
invite our families.

12
00:00:18,063 --> 00:00:19,393
(Leonard:)Is your brother out of prison?

13
00:00:19,398 --> 00:00:21,568
(Penny:)Thanks to overcrowding, yeah.

14
00:00:21,567 --> 00:00:24,667
(Leonard:)I'd love it
if my dad could come.

15
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:26,040
(Penny:)Oh, you have to invite him.

16
00:00:26,038 --> 00:00:27,508
(Penny:)I haven't seen him
since the divorce.

17
00:00:27,506 --> 00:00:29,406
(Leonard:)Oh, he's like a different man.

18
00:00:29,408 --> 00:00:31,008
(Leonard:)Oh.
He stopped twitching,

19
00:00:31,009 --> 00:00:33,479
(Leonard:)and I think he grew
an inch and a half.

20
00:00:33,479 --> 00:00:35,379
(Penny:)Well, then it's settled.

21
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:36,710
(Penny:)Yay.

22
00:00:36,715 --> 00:00:37,715
(Howard:)God.

23
00:00:37,716 --> 00:00:38,886
(Penny:)So funny.

24
00:00:38,884 --> 00:00:41,314
(Penny:)I never thought my second
marriage would be to you!

25
00:00:43,021 --> 00:00:46,661
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

